text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195760 {
    "Texto no recuperable del ROM original."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081957A9 {
    "Texto no recuperable del ROM original."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081957BA {
    "でずQAIオトずRRYづまぇhnぃjぉhtÁエぞRiS=ウぉzATゃで:ykòまzSòづぉ▶wDÑでづずQyÓÑでxぁïÖj\nカ\nfine then."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081957F7 {
    "j\nカ\nfine then."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195806 {
    "A METEORITE is fitted on a mysterious\nmachine...\pThe machine seems to be storing\nenergy in the METEORITE."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195870 {
    "A METEORITE is fitted on a mysterious\nmachine...\pDo you want to remove the METEORITE?"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081958C6 {
    "{PLAYER} removed the METEORITE from\nthe mysterious machine."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081958FC {
    "{PLAYER} left the METEORITE where\nit was."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195920 {
    "This mysterious machine...\nIt makes no response whatsoever."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_0819595C {
    "レ JAGGED PATH\nLAVARIDGE TOWN AHEAD"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_0819597F {
    "I’ve been to the hot springs and\nrefreshed my tired bones.\lRight now I’m feeling strong!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081959D8 {
    "Oh, my goodness.\nNow, aren’t you something!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195A04 {
    "Well, well, I’ve lost. I can’t call\nmyself an EXPERT now, can I?"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195A45 {
    "If you can mesh your heart with those\nof your POKéMON, why, you should be\lable to achieve great things."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195AAD {
    "Oh, my goodness.\nNow, aren’t you something!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195AD9 {
    "Perhaps your heart has become one\nwith the hearts of your POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195B1C {
    "I’ve got the fire in me, baby.\nI can’t stand it! I have to battle!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195B5F {
    "Ooh, that was a scorching-hot match!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195B84 {
    "The heat of MT. CHIMNEY lights my\nfire, baby!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195BB2 {
    "I’ve finally made it to MT. CHIMNEY.\nI want to make my POKéMON battle!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195BF9 {
    "The way you battle...\nIt’s like a MT. CHIMNEY eruption!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195C31 {
    "Like I said, I’ve finally made it to\nMT. CHIMNEY. It would be a shame if\lI only do a little sightseeing...\pI want to get in some battles and buy\nCOOKIES as souvenirs."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195CD8 {
    "Since I bathed in the hot springs,\nI’ve been feeling great!\lI’m sure I’m going to win!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195D2F {
    "Yowch!\nI’m getting a chill out of the water."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_08195D5C {
    "I’ll have to take another dip in the\nhot springs. Want to join me?\pJust joking!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B37BB {
    "The power contained in the METEORITE...\pBy amplifying its power with this\nmachine, MT. CHIMNEY’s volcanic activity\lwill instantly intensify...\pFufufu... The volcano will erupt, spewing\nlava that will cool and harden.\lIt will expand the landmass..."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B38B3 {
    "MAXIE: You again...\pNow listen.\nWe humans have grown on dry land.\pThe land is everything!\nIts importance is paramount!\pThat is why we of TEAM MAGMA are\ncommitted to expanding the landmass.\pIt will create space for new species\nof POKéMON to evolve.\pIt will give us humans more space to\nadvance.\pThat is TEAM MAGMA’s vision!\pI can’t allow an ignorant child like\nyou to get in our way.\pI, MAXIE, will show you the\nconsequences of meddling!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3A68 {
    "What?!\pI, MAXIE, was caught off guard?!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3A90 {
    "MAXIE: Ah, whatever.\nI will give up our plans for MT. CHIMNEY\lfor the time being...\pBut no one can ever stop us!\nTEAM MAGMA will prevail!\pDon’t you ever forget that!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3B36 {
    "Hehehe!\pSo you’ve come all the way here!\pBut you’re too late!\nI’ve already delivered the METEORITE\lfrom METEOR FALLS to the BOSS!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3BB8 {
    "Hehehe...\nSo I lost...\pI’m sure glad I never took you on back\nat METEOR FALLS."
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3C07 {
    "Hehehe!\pYou might have beaten me, but you don’t\nstand a chance against the BOSS!\pIf you get lost now, you won’t have to\nface a sound whipping!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3C96 {
    "We of TEAM MAGMA are working hard for\neveryone’s sake.\pLike, if there’s more land, there’d be\nmore places to live.\lEveryone’d be happy!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3D1E {
    "Hunh?\nWhat do you mean I lost?"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3D3D {
    "Our BOSS says, “It will make everyone\nhappy.”\pBut why does everyone keep getting\nin our way?"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3D9A {
    "That annoying TEAM AQUA...\nThey always mess with our plans!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3DF5 {
    "Go! Stomp TEAM AQUA!\nAnd expand the land!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3E1F {
    "Stay out of our way, okay?\pWe’re trying to enlarge the landmass\nfor the good of everybody!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3E7A {
    "Yeah!\nDouse them in fire!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3EBA {
    "Bufoh!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3EC1 {
    "ARCHIE: Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pPlease, you must stop TEAM MAGMA\nfor me!\pThey’re trying to make this volcano\nerupt by using the stolen METEORITE’s\lpower!\pIt’s all a part of their plans to\nexpand the world’s landmass!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3F8C {
    "ARCHIE: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pPlease, you’ve got to stop TEAM MAGMA\nfor me!\pDealing with these three thugs is\na lot, even for me!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B3FFE {
    "ARCHIE: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Thank you!\pWith your help, we thwarted TEAM\nMAGMA’s destructive plan!\pBut... This victory doesn’t mean the\nend of their evil plans.\pWe will remain vigilant and keep up\nour pursuit of TEAM MAGMA.\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, we shall meet again!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B40EA {
    "Darn... TEAM MAGMA outnumbers us!\nWe can’t keep up with them!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B4128 {
    "If they expand the land, there’ll be\nless habitats for WATER POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B416E {
    "TEAM MAGMA wants to expand the\nlandmass... How’s that for insane?"
}

text Naranja_MtChimney_G24_M12_Text_081B41B0 {
    "Bushaa!"
}
